m; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/d7062e29b80c30a130937fb5f0ac9475.mp4?t=1764268825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get more copies of cards needed for your preferred combinations and add them to your deck. Take out cards that don't fit your strategy by strategically burning them away during battles. The approach might be different but the goal is the same:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mold your deck into the most optimized destruction machine you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your Party</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poker Monsters offers a variety of Heroes to recruit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/7b217b4a4b9866fe09d80d69fbfb0646.poster.avif?t=1764268825\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/7b217b4a4b9866fe09d80d69fbfb0646.webm?t=1764268825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/7b217b4a4b9866fe09d80d69fbfb0646.mp4?t=1764268825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick the Heroes you think are best suited for the Hunt and venture forth. You\u2019ll permanently unlock new Heroes as you progress through the game. Go wild and experiment with Party composition to find which adventurers work best together and use their abilities to gain the upper hand. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your Board</strong><br>Deck and Party are not the only tools at your disposal, change the Board itself by getting:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coupons, to change the value of your combos. Make Two Pair more powerful than Flush if you desire!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patches, to \u201cpatch up\u201d your combo by manipulating a card\u2019s property during the battle. Turn a 2 of Spades into a 2 of Hearts to get that Straight Flush just right!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/6068c3b634888fb97c4d61c424513e7c.poster.avif?t=1764268825\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/6068c3b634888fb97c4d61c424513e7c.webm?t=1764268825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/6068c3b634888fb97c4d61c424513e7c.mp4?t=1764268825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Un-Lock Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/2613d754d6762fe3856e9a517106fc943a53ec07/header.jpg?t=1764268825","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Poker Monsters","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-8300H CPU @ 2.30GHz   2.30 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16,0 GB GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Un-Lock Studio"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewal