4215d73588.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764268825","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/2c570bbb84eab1d29f482f46fedcd24215d73588/ss_2c570bbb84eab1d29f482f46fedcd24215d73588.600x338.jpg?t=1764268825"}],"short_description":"A new take on Poker Roguelike. In Poker Monsters, you assemble poker hands on the table one card at a time, with one goal: hunting! Use your party\u2019s abilities, take down huge beasts and power up using the monsters\u2019 own cards. Become a true Poker Monster!","steam_appid":3768150,"support_info":{"email":"info.unlockstudio@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}